.126">There's </span><span begin="00:58.126" end="00:58.862">nothing </span><span begin="00:58.862" end="00:59.038">I </span><span begin="00:59.038" end="00:59.430">won't </span><span begin="00:59.430" end="01:00.254">do</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.670" end="01:05.006"><span begin="01:00.670" end="01:01.198">I'd </span><span begin="01:01.198" end="01:01.672">risk </span><span begin="01:01.672" end="01:02.185">it </span><span begin="01:02.185" end="01:03.255">all </span><span begin="01:03.255" end="01:03.670">for </span><span begin="01:03.670" end="01:05.006">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.263" end="01:11.662"><span begin="01:07.263" end="01:07.446">To </span><span begin="01:07.446" end="01:07.647">hold </span><span begin="01:07.647" end="01:07.831">your </span><span begin="01:07.831" end="01:08.991">hand </span><span begin="01:10.110" end="01:10.295">and </span><span begin="01:10.295" end="01:10.494">call </span><span begin="01:10.494" end="01:10.854">you </span><span begin="01:10.854" end="01:11.662">mine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.519" end="01:17.254"><span begin="01:12.519" end="01:12.710">I'm </span><span begin="01:12.710" end="01:13.000">tryna </span><span begin="01:13.000" end="01:13.207">be </span><span begin="01:13.207" end="01:13.467">your </span><span begin="01:13.467" end="01:14.461">man </span><span begin="01:15.070" end="01:15.285">'til </span><span begin="01:15.285" end="01:15.486">the </span><span begin="01:15.486" end="01:15.862">end </span><span begin="01:15.862" end="01:16.406">of </span><span begin="01:16.406" end="01:17.254">time</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.934" end="01:28.126"><span begin="01:17.934" end="01:18.607">Oh </span><span begin="01:18.607" end="01:18.815">I'll </span><span begin="01:18.815" end="01:18.973">do </span><span begin="01:18.973" end="01:20.270">anything </span><span begin="01:21.726" end="01:22.642">anything </span><span begin="01:22.642" end="01:23.063">you </span><span 