" end="01:43.599">I </span><span begin="01:43.599" end="01:44.062">won't </span><span begin="01:44.062" end="01:44.768">do</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.479" end="01:49.918"><span begin="01:45.479" end="01:45.822">I'd </span><span begin="01:45.822" end="01:46.310">risk </span><span begin="01:46.310" end="01:46.822">it </span><span begin="01:46.822" end="01:47.822">all </span><span begin="01:47.822" end="01:48.261">for </span><span begin="01:48.261" end="01:49.918">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.022" end="01:56.198"><span begin="01:52.022" end="01:52.222">I </span><span begin="01:52.222" end="01:52.554">would </span><span begin="01:52.554" end="01:53.366">swim </span><span begin="01:53.366" end="01:53.689">across </span><span begin="01:53.689" end="01:53.941">the </span><span begin="01:53.941" end="01:54.672">sea </span><span begin="01:54.672" end="01:54.896">just </span><span begin="01:54.896" end="01:55.110">to </span><span begin="01:55.110" end="01:55.602">show </span><span begin="01:55.602" end="01:56.198">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.564" end="02:02.173"><span begin="01:57.564" end="01:58.590">Sacrifice </span><span begin="01:58.590" end="01:59.030">my </span><span begin="01:59.030" end="01:59.670">life </span><span begin="01:59.670" end="02:00.350">just </span><span begin="02:00.350" end="02:00.670">to </span><span begin="02:00.670" end="02:01.365">hold </span><span begin="02:01.365" end="02:02.173">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.485" end="02:04.822"><span begin="02:02.485" end="02:03.182">I </span><span begin="02:03.182" end="02:03.453">could </span><span begin="02:03.453" end="02:03.653">go </span><span begin="02:03.653" end="02:04.037">on </span><span begin="02:04.037" end="02:04.199">and </span><span begin="02:04.199" end="02:04.822">on</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.318" end="02:12.006"><span begin="02:05.318" end="02:05.518">To </span><span begin="02:05.518" end="02:05.853">prove </span><spa